+        "description": "Iran with its 31 provinces as nations, from the Caspian Sea in the north to the Persian Gulf and the Gulf of Oman in the south. Its rivers, such as the Karun, Karkheh, Aras and Sefidrud, are one tile wide: armies cannot walk across them, but boats can sail them.",
+        "themes": ["asia"],
